---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Thanks wall"
description: "A small wall of kindness from typists who took the time to send a thanks note."
permalink: /thanks-wall/
---

<div class="article-body" style="max-width:920px;margin:var(--space-5) auto;padding:0 var(--space-4)">
  <header class="page__head">
    <p class="eyebrow">Community</p>
    <h1>Thanks wall</h1>
    <p class="article-lede">Short notes of appreciation from people who took the time to send one. Each one made the project a little brighter. <a href="/contribute/thanks-note/">Add yours →</a></p>
  </header>

  {% if thanks_notes.length > 0 %}
  <div class="thanks-wall">
    {% for n in thanks_notes %}
    <article class="thanks-card">
      <p>{{ n.body }}</p>
      <p class="thanks-card__byline">
        -- <strong>{{ n.name or "Anonymous" }}</strong>
        {% if n.date %} · <span>{{ n.date | readableDate }}</span>{% endif %}
      </p>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% else %}
  <div class="stats-empty" style="padding:var(--space-6);text-align:center">
    <p>No notes on the wall yet -- but the first one could be yours.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:var(--space-3)"><a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contribute/thanks-note/">Send a thanks note →</a></p>
  </div>
  {% endif %}
</div>
